flowchart TD
 A[Speak or type English] --> B{Input method}
 B -->|Microphone| C[Capture audio and recognize speech]
 B -->|Typed| D[Editable transcript]
 C --> D
 D --> E[POST /api/generate]
 E --> F{Sentence sequence found?}
 F -->|Yes| G[Load sentence frames]
 F -->|No| H{Exact CSV gloss found?}
 H -->|Yes| I[Tokenize gloss and resolve sign assets]
 H -->|No| J[English A-Z fallback]
 I -->|Missing token asset| J
 G --> K[OpenCV MP4 rendering]
 I --> K
 J --> K
 K --> L[Return MP4 + mode header]
 L --> M[Preview and playback]
